          <msContents>
            <summary>Series of coloured drawings of plants, with names in German or Latin. Followed by notes on urology and miscellaneous medical receipts in German. The illustrations are carefully drawn and natural representations, probably copied from a middle 16th cent. German herbal. On the last leaf is a prayer in German, dated 1802.</summary>
